Author-Name: Wafik M. GRAIS
Author-Workplace-Name: Université du Québec à Montréal
Title: A Multi-Sectoral Model of the Supply Side Application to Egypt
Abstract: In the framework of a sequential equilibrium planning model, an explanation of labour demand allowing for discrepancies between implicit and actual wages is put forward. An extension of the input-output price system to take account of decreasing returns to scale is considered by introducing surpluses. The model is applied to Egypt on the period 1970-1989.
