Title: The Influence of the 1974 Oil Crisis on Sectoral Growth Rates in the Belgian Economy
Abstract: This paper briefly presents and analyses the behaviour of the different sectors of the Belgian economy during the period 1965-1978. Special attention is paid to the influence of the 1974 oil crisis on sectors of the Belgian economy. It is shown that the 1974 shock had different consequences according to the energy components of the sector
