Title: Price Formation and the Scope for Oligopolistic Conduct in a Small Open Economy
Abstract: The aim of this paper is to derive and test equilibrium relations between aggregated indices of market power, concentration and foreign trade variables. Encaoua and Jacquemin (1980) established such relationships between different measures of concentration and Lerner indices, but do not take into account international competition.
