Author-Name: M.P. DONSIMONI
Author-Workplace-Name: Université catholique de Louvain, CRIDE
Author-Name: V. LEOZ-ARGUELLES
Author-Workplace-Name: Université catholique de Louvain, CRIDE
Title: Strategic Groups : an Application to Foreign and Domestic Firms in Spain
Abstract: The purpose of this paper is to go one step further and to abandon the industry-wide approach, in order to take into account the existence of strategic groups. The hypothesis according to which industries with substantial proportion of strategic groups do not fit the structure performance paradigm as well as industries with lesser amount of these groups had to be validated. Indeed, the former industries behave closer to strategic groups than the latter. Hence, if one believes, as is the case here, that strategic groups, not industries, respond differentially to the same market constraint, one must abandon the industry approach and substitute a strategic group approach.
Length: 16
Series: UNIVERSITE CATHOLIQUE DE LOUVAIN, Institut de Sciences Economiques
