Title: The Life Cycle Hypothesis and Rational Expectations : Some Further Empirical Results
Abstract: The purpose of this note is to present some further empirical results on the validity of the martingale property using post-war data for mine countries. The major novelty in the note is that we address four issues which have received little or no attention in previous empirical studies. 
