Title: Aggregate Investment and Output in the U. K.
Abstract: In this paper we have a threefold objective. Firstly, to identify the principal macroeconomic determinants of U.K. private sector investment. Secondly, to examine the effects of private investment on aggregate supply. Finally, we attempt to integrate the effects of public sector investment and pricing on private sector output.
