Author-Name: Alfred STEINHERR
Author-Workplace-Name: UNIVERSITE CATHOLIQUE DE LOUVAIN, Department of Economics
Title: Policy Coordination in the European Economic Community
Abstract: The purpose of this paper is to reflect on some fundamental issues : 
(i)What do we mean by the much used terms – convergence, coordination, hamonisation ? 
(ii) What is the need for, potential gains of coordination in the community
(iii) What explains the evident limits ans difficulty of coordination ?
(iv) What should be the aims of coordination : in what areas is it both desirable and feasible ? 
