Author-Name: Edmond MALINVAUD
Author-Workplace-Name: Collège de France
Title: Econométrie de l’investissement 
Length: 9
Series: UNIVERSITE CATHOLIQUE DE LOUVAIN, Institut de Sciences Economiques
Number: 1988021
Creation-Date: 1988-06-01
File-URL: http://www.jstor.org/stable/40723855
